cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PhishVN, please cite the dataset as below."
title: "PhishVN: A Time-Stamped Vietnamese URL Phishing Dataset with Impersonation-Scenario Labels and Confidence Tiers"
abstract: >-
  An open, time-stamped Vietnamese URL phishing dataset of 53,116 URLs (an 18,997-record
  verified core of 2,587 phishing / 16,410 legitimate, plus a 34,119-record community/feed
  expansion) with a 21-feature CompPhish-aligned lexical schema, impersonation-scenario labels,
  gold/silver label-confidence tiers, and a group-aware temporal split. Includes a preliminary
  paired HTML/screenshot subset.
type: dataset
version: 3.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-08"
license: CC-BY-4.0
